Boundary notes:
  hashicorp-vault-ops = Vault-the-product (seal/unseal, secret engines incl. its own PKI engine,
  auth methods, policies, Agent/VSO, replication, namespaces, HA cluster operations).
  secrets-hygiene owns secret-handling hygiene and the secrets-management plus PKI concept layer
  (chain of trust, CA hierarchy, key types, revocation). cert-manager owns the Kubernetes
  certificate-issuance controller; lets-encrypt owns the public ACME CA and certbot. Vault's PKI
  engine can act as an ACME provider, which is the consuming link to those two skills. No content
  duplication: this skill covers Vault CLI/API/HCL specifics; the concept layer routes up to
  secrets-hygiene.

